        "content": "What function calculates an investor’s net dollar return for a hedge fund using a 2-and-20 fee structure, where the management fee is charged on year-end assets under management, the incentive fee is charged on returns exceeding a specified hurdle rate after deducting the management fee, and the result is returned in millions rounded to two decimal places?",
